00:11:11,548 --> 00:11:18,308
I thought I'd grown up when I went to a live concert that New Year's Eve.

248
00:11:18,308 --> 00:11:25,788
And then Kobayashi sang the theme song for Mashroute on mc before she sang the theme song.

249
00:11:25,788 --> 00:11:31,148
He said something about a tie-up, like it was the first tie-up in a long time.

250
00:11:31,148 --> 00:11:37,908
Like, "Thank you for the tie-up." I wonder if he's learned about tie-ups recently.

251
00:11:37,908 --> 00:11:41,052
I've memorized it, so I knew it was there.

252
00:11:41,052 --> 00:11:45,052
He was very appealing and mature.

253
00:11:45,052 --> 00:11:47,052
That's where it's important.

254
00:11:47,052 --> 00:11:52,052
Back to the topic at hand, I joined Ebi Junior High.

255
00:11:52,052 --> 00:11:56,052
You two are in the same class, but have you met the other members of Ebichu?

256
00:11:56,052 --> 00:11:58,052
Before or when you were under Daioh...

257
00:11:58,052 --> 00:12:06,052
I went to see a live performance once with Daioh and below.

258
00:12:06,052 --> 00:12:07,052
But that's about it.

259
00:12:07,052 --> 00:12:10,052
Just a hello, really.

260
00:12:10,524 --> 00:12:12,524
We didn't know each other.

261
00:12:12,524 --> 00:12:15,524
But I went to your free shows.

262
00:12:15,524 --> 00:12:17,524
I see.

263
00:12:17,524 --> 00:12:19,524
Did you see him one way or the other?

264
00:12:19,524 --> 00:12:21,524
I saw them one way or another.

265
00:12:21,524 --> 00:12:23,524
Is there some kind of first meeting?

266
00:12:23,524 --> 00:12:29,524
The day I joined was an event at the office.

267
00:12:29,524 --> 00:12:37,524
It was an event like a festival where all the female idols from Momokuro gathered.

268
00:12:37,708 --> 00:12:41,508
Momokuro was going to announce her joining the group at a live performance.

269
00:12:41,508 --> 00:12:46,648
I was greeted by Ebinaka as Hiroka Oyo before the show.

270
00:12:46,648 --> 00:12:50,588
I was greeting her as Ebinaka-san.

271
00:12:50,588 --> 00:12:53,488
But by the time the show was over, I was Ebinaka.

272
00:12:53,488 --> 00:12:58,088
So I greeted him in the make-up room.

273
00:12:58,088 --> 00:12:59,588
Did you see anyone other than Ebinaka at that time?

274
00:12:59,588 --> 00:13:00,868
There were a lot of people there.

275
00:13:00,868 --> 00:13:02,868
I'd like to see a lot of other idols.

276
00:13:02,868 --> 00:13:04,628
That's right.

277
00:13:04,628 --> 00:13:05,428
I see.

278
00:13:05,428 --> 00:13:07,368
How was Nakayama? First time.

279
00:13:07,388 --> 00:13:10,448
I've never met you... or any of the other girls before.

280
00:13:10,448 --> 00:13:15,548
Yeah, but I really liked him. He liked Ebichu.

281
00:13:15,548 --> 00:13:18,768
Are you really going to work with these guys?

282
00:13:18,768 --> 00:13:20,768
Yeah, we're going to be together.

283
00:13:20,768 --> 00:13:24,348
And our show starts in two months, right?

284
00:13:24,348 --> 00:13:29,448
Then I feel like I don't know what's right or left at all.

285
00:13:29,448 --> 00:13:32,288
That's right.

286
00:13:32,288 --> 00:13:35,969
That was our show. What else was there? And what else?

287
00:13:35,996 --> 00:13:42,796
Live performances... You didn't do any other variety shows?

288
00:13:42,796 --> 00:13:46,396
Radio?

289
00:13:47,396 --> 00:13:52,676
Really? You didn't know anything about variety?

290
00:13:52,676 --> 00:13:58,396
I didn't even know what Evival was.

291
00:13:58,396 --> 00:14:04,396
The first thing I did was not Tastus. It was Ebibal.

292
00:14:04,476 --> 00:14:11,156
But I've been watching the two of you and Ebichu, and I'm thinking that maybe you really think I'm a scary person.

293
00:14:11,156 --> 00:14:15,856
I was thinking that maybe he really thinks I'm scary or something.

294
00:14:15,856 --> 00:14:18,940
Especially Nakayama.

295
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:26,380
Even if you are scary, there was a rumor that Takei-san has dark eyes, so he always wears eyeliner.

296
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:28,760
It's like you put on a lot of makeup.

297
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:33,260
That's what Yasumoto told me.

298
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:36,460
After about six months...

299
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:39,996
Yasumoto or Takei?

300
00:14:39,996 --> 00:14:41,996
She said you wear eyeliner.

301
00:14:41,996 --> 00:14:43,996
Wait a minute. You always thought so?

302
00:14:43,996 --> 00:14:44,996
Are you ashamed?

303
00:14:44,996 --> 00:14:45,996
Even when we're backstage together.

304
00:14:45,996 --> 00:14:46,996
Yeah.

305
00:14:46,996 --> 00:14:47,996
You're wearing eyeliner?

306
00:14:47,996 --> 00:14:48,996
That's fine. I'm not wearing eyeliner.

307
00:14:48,996 --> 00:14:49,996
No makeup, no makeup.

308
00:14:49,996 --> 00:14:51,996
More like no makeup.

309
00:14:51,996 --> 00:14:52,996
She said that.

310
00:14:52,996 --> 00:14:53,996
That's right, that's right.

311
00:14:53,996 --> 00:14:54,996
That was embarrassing.

312
00:14:54,996 --> 00:14:55,996
That's what people thought of me.

313
00:14:55,996 --> 00:14:56,996
Yeah.

314
00:14:56,996 --> 00:14:59,996
So it was really a gradual process.

315
00:14:59,996 --> 00:15:01,996
Gradually you became friends with everyone.

316
00:15:01,996 --> 00:15:02,996
That's right.

317
00:15:02,996 --> 00:15:04,996
I'm glad I joined Ebisu Rose.

318
00:15:04,996 --> 00:15:05,996
I see.

319
00:15:05,996 --> 00:15:06,996
That's where we became good friends.

320
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:15,640
My image of Kobayashi is that he's good at getting around, and he's like a puppy, he gets along with everyone.

321
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:22,420
He's like Yasumoto's disciple. He's still my disciple. He still is.

322
00:15:22,420 --> 00:15:30,280
That's why Yasumoto loves him so much.

323
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:33,580
Nakayama... I wonder... Nakayama was really absent-minded.

324
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:39,580
Nakayama's right. You didn't think anything of it. But you got along well with Kobayashi.

325
00:15:39,580 --> 00:15:45,760
They were in the same class. They got along well here, and Kobayashi adored Yasumoto.

326
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:50,460
I wonder if I have an image of that... how it really was.

327
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:54,680
Nakayama... how did they get along?

328
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:59,460
Nakayama... this person was like this... Nakayama... that's right...

329
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:01,100
Nakayama with someone who's sure about Nakayama

330
00:16:01,132 --> 00:16:08,852
Nakayama I think he got along with everyone without looking at them. Nakamura Who were you afraid of?

331
00:16:08,852 --> 00:16:13,852
NakamuraI want to talk about that time NakamuraThere is no one to be afraid of anymore NakamuraThere is no one to be afraid of

332
00:16:13,852 --> 00:16:19,308
NakamuraI don't know if I was scared of him or if I didn't know how to talk to him.

333
00:16:19,308 --> 00:16:25,588
NakamuraHow should I talk to you because you are my senior? NakayamaWell, as far as Nakayama is concerned...

334
00:16:25,588 --> 00:16:30,268
I think it's hard for people as a whole to relate to each other

335
00:16:30,268 --> 00:16:33,948
All of humanity. Nakamura, we're all in this together. I thought so, too.

336
00:16:33,948 --> 00:16:40,068
Nakamura, I wonder what I should say to you.

337
00:16:40,068 --> 00:16:43,388
That's why I asked the other day.

338
00:16:43,388 --> 00:16:47,088
NakamuraAh, here it comes! Here it comes!

339
00:16:47,088 --> 00:16:49,088
NakamuraLet's find out!
